mplexity\": \"L\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"cli\": \"Codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"effort\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"base_commit\": \"d644c75a22b00b92480ce4631a7d4e52e5219f70\",\n  \"writer\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"T-081-deny-path\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"383dd052-109d-41b5-85cb-40e1c65a221c\",\n    \"session_id\": \"46d5b6f4-f84e-4298-8fcb-d784dcaf17b8\",\n    \"fence\": 1,\n    \"thread_id\": \"b4e9ac3f-6807-4d7b-9c06-e9b8f0b7bfcd\"\n  }\n}\n\n受管身份：{\"command\":\"submit\",\"task\":\"T-081-deny-path\",\"attempt\":\"383dd052-109d-41b5-85cb-40e1c65a221c\",\"session\":\"46d5b6f4-f84e-4298-8fcb-d784dcaf17b8\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/t81-i8fzus_w/paths/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/q76-kxuborzp/c-a76_w9_d/state' 'submit' '--task' 'T-081-deny-path' '--attempt' '383dd052-109d-41b5-85cb-40e1c65a221c' '--session' '46d5b6f4-f84e-4298-8fcb-d784dcaf17b8' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-15T08:53:17.209Z","task":"T-081-deny-path","attempt":"383dd052-109d-41b5-85cb-40e1c65a221c","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"T-081-deny-path","attempt_id":"383dd052-109d-41b5-85cb-40e1c65a221c","session_id":"46d5b6f4-f84e-4298-8fcb-d784dcaf17b8","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"b4e9ac3f-6807-4d7b-9c06-e9b8f0b7bfcd","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtim